{"overview":"از زمانی که به یاد دارد، ایچیگو کوروساکی می‌تواند ارواح را ببیند. اما وقتی با روکیا، یک شبح‌کُش که با ارواح شرور به نام هالوها می‌جنگد، آشنا می‌شود، زندگی‌اش برای همیشه تغییر می‌کند. اکنون با انرژی روحانی تازه‌ای، ایچیگو می‌فهمد هدف واقعی‌اش این است که زنده‌ها و مرده‌ها را از شر محافظت کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"For as long as he can remember, Ichigo Kurosaki has been able to see ghosts. But when he meets Rukia, a Soul Reaper who battles evil spirits known as Hollows, he finds his life is changed forever. Now, with a newfound wealth of spiritual energy, Ichigo discovers his true calling: to protect the living and the dead from evil.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":4,"y":2004,"poster":"/bxmbx54WhY7XFjRaQA4TmWxhucC.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":366,"y":2004,"poster":"/bxmbx54WhY7XFjRaQA4TmWxhucC.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":50,"y":2022,"poster":"/2cT8jkEVsAL86CVKALR4pnaVLDb.jpg"}],"episodes":416,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"森田成一","role":"Ichigo Kurosaki (voice)","photo":"/2INsHYbx9gEhhzXPHdqBDdvHjFt.jpg","en":"Masakazu Morita"},{"name":"折笠富美子","role":"Rukia Kuchiki (voice)","photo":"/f5d1J13fksa1hK8u7AS95aO8b9.jpg","en":"Fumiko Orikasa"},{"name":"安元洋貴","role":"Yasutora Sado (voice)","photo":"/vNIGLl0wFmdhdnulMssQ1qyNeBs.jpg","en":"Hiroki Yasumoto"},{"name":"松岡由貴","role":"Orihime Inoue (voice)","photo":"/e8rNkMM9O7ULA1RJtLbvkN9789v.jpg","en":"Yuki Matsuoka"},{"name":"杉山紀彰","role":"Uryu Ishida (voice)","photo":"/szqqQ8T0gzuSxjU2rnWcthsaSJT.jpg","en":"Noriaki Sugiyama"}],"trailer":"0c4IoCA5fY0","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/30984-bleach/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPWN8YgQHjWm.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"},{"n":"Google Play Movies","kind":"buy","logo":"